{"page":90,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:75","surah":4,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا لَكُمْ لَا تُقَـٰتِلُونَ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَٱلْمُسْتَضْعَفِينَ مِنَ ٱلرِّجَالِ وَٱلنِّسَآءِ وَٱلْوِلْدَٰنِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَقُولُونَ رَبَّنَآ أَخْرِجْنَا مِنْ هَـٰذِهِ ٱلْقَرْيَةِ ٱلظَّالِمِ أَهْلُهَا وَٱجْعَل لَّنَا مِن لَّدُنكَ وَلِيًّا وَٱجْعَل لَّنَا مِن لَّدُنكَ نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Why should you not fight in God’s cause and for those oppressed men, women, and children who cry out, ‘Lord, rescue us from this town whose people are oppressors! By Your grace, give us a protector and give us a helper!’?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(that) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تُقَـٰتِلُونَ","en_gloss":"you fight","transliteration":"tuqātilūna","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْمُسْتَضْعَفِينَ","en_gloss":"and (for) those who are weak","transliteration":"wal-mus'taḍʿafīna","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلرِّجَالِ","en_gloss":"the men","transliteration":"l-rijāli","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلنِّسَآءِ","en_gloss":"and the women","transliteration":"wal-nisāi","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْوِلْدَٰنِ","en_gloss":"and the children","transliteration":"wal-wil'dāni","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"4:75"},{"pos