ers fight for God’s cause, while those who reject faith fight for an unjust cause. Fight the allies of Satan: Satan’s strategies are truly weak.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُقَـٰتِلُونَ","en_gloss":"they fight","transliteration":"yuqātilūna","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"who disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُقَـٰتِلُونَ","en_gloss":"they fight","transliteration":"yuqātilūna","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the false deities","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūti","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَقَـٰتِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"So fight (against)","transliteration":"faqātilū","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) friends","transliteration":"awliyāa","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كَيْدَ","en_gloss":"(the) strategy","transliteration":"kayda","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","verse_key":"4:76"},{"pos":19,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","tran